%% Research and learning loop — adopted owner-amended baseline; unresolved parameters remain in the Open Decisions register.
flowchart LR
  Knowledge[Knowledge / observations] --> Hypothesis[Preregistered hypothesis]
  Hypothesis --> Backtest[Pinned point-in-time backtest]
  Backtest --> Holdout[Out-of-sample / walk-forward validation]
  Holdout --> Paper[Isolated paper experiment]
  Paper --> Evidence[Evidence / uncertainty / costs]
  Evidence --> League[Offline multi-metric Strategy and AI scorecards]
  League --> Findings[Positive / negative / inconclusive findings]
  Findings --> Knowledge
  League --> Review[Owner promotion review]
  Review -->|Approved with regression gates| Version[Versioned qualification / allocation policy; no direct orders]
  Review -->|Rejected or insufficient| Findings
  Version --> Hypothesis
